## A matte sphere lit by one ambientlight alone, no Option naming an
## indirect-light pass: the baseline every other indirectseam_*.rib
## variant compares against. Not third-party.
Display "indirectseam_none.tif" "file" "rgba"
Format 48 48 1
Projection "perspective" "fov" [45]
Clipping 0.5 50
Translate 0 0 5
WorldBegin
LightSource "ambientlight" 1 "intensity" [0.3931372549019608]
Surface "matte" "Ka" [1] "Kd" [1]
Color [1 1 1]
Opacity [1 1 1]
Sphere 1 -1 1 360
WorldEnd
